Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Sometimes I use the # to help visually separate blocks of ui.R script.

block 1
#-------------------------------------------------
block 2
#-------------------------------------------------
block 3
#-------------------------------------------------
block 4

I also add # end of function_name at the ends of long functions. Look below for example.
Aside from that, keep your indentation style consistent

EX: (I don't really need #---------------------- in this one, but they can be useful in longer or more convoluted ui.R.
shinyUI(
  fluidPage(
     titlePanel(),

     sidebarLayout(
        sidebarPanel(
           textInput(),
           textInput(),
           textInput(),
           actionButton(),
           uiOutput("chooseDatabases")
                    ), #sidebarPanel() end parantheses

        mainPanel(
           tabsetPanel(
                  tabPanel("",
                           plotOutput("graph1", width = 1200, height = 700)
                           ),
                  tabPanel("",
                           plotOutput("graph2", width = 1200, height = 700)
                  ),
                  tabPanel("",
                           plotOutput("graph3", width = 1200, height = 700)
                  ),
                  tabPanel("",
                           plotOutput("graph4", width = 1200, height = 700)
                  ),
                  tabPanel("",
                           plotOutput("graph5", width = 1200, height = 700)
                  ),
                  tabPanel("",
                           verbatimTextOutput(""),
                           verbatimTextOutput(""),
                           verbatimTextOutput("")
                          ),
                  tabPanel("Table",
                           tableOutput("Table1"),
                           tableOutput("Table2"),
                           tableOutput("Table3"),
                           tableOutput("Table4"),
                           tableOutput("Table5")
                           )
                       )#tabsetPanel() end parantheses
                )#mainPanel() end parantheses
            )#sidebarLayout() end parantheses
       )#fluidPage() end parantheses
   )#shinyUI() end parantheses

