Can you try adding this line to the top of server.R?

options(shiny.usecairo=FALSE)

Shiny will use Cairo <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/Cairo/index.html> automatically if it's available. Usually this results in higher quality output, but sometimes the reverse is true.

